==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hvenar|lang=non}} or {{term|hvenær|lang=non}} (spelt ''hvenar'' in [[w:en:Droplaugarsona saga|Droplaugarsona saga]]).

